<title>PAKISTAN: HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE TOURNAMENT RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-GOLDEN JUBILEE TOURNAMENT RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Golden Jubilee</p>
<p>of Pakistan men's hockey tournament on Saturday:</p>
<p>Germany 3 Netherlands 1 (halftime 0-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p> Germany     - Oliver Domke 49, Christian Blunck 50,</p>
<p>		   Christian Bechmann 67</p>
<p>Netherlands - Bram Lomans 29</p>
<p>Australia 3 Pakistan 3 (2-2)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p> Australia   - Matthew Smith 12, Jeremy Hiskins 28,</p>
<p>		   Stephen Davies 40</p>
<p> Pakistan    - Rahim Khan 25, Muhammad Khalid Jnr 34,</p>
<p>		   Muhammad Shahbaz 55</p>
<p>    Final group standings Pl   W   D   L    F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Germany			 4   3   1   0   10    5   10</p>
<p> Netherlands		   4   2   1   1   13    8    7</p>
<p> Australia		     4   1   1   2   11   10    4</p>
<p> Pakistan			4   0   4   0   10   10    4</p>
<p> England			 4   0   1   3    3   14    1</p>
<p>Sunday's matches:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p> Germany   v Netherlands</p>
<p>Third place play-off</p>
<p>Australia v Pakistan</p>
</text>
